id: cuda-samples-automated
unit: test plan
_name: Prebuilt cuda-samples tests (automated)
_description:
 Runs every sample from a prebuilt cuda-samples tree as its own job.
 Samples listed in the exclude-jobs JSON file still generate jobs but
 are skipped visibly through their resource skip flag.
include:
    cuda/samples-readiness
    cuda-sample/.*
bootstrap_include:
    com.canonical.certification::cuda_samples_resource
